OL,3,GNEWSAUrban explorers urged to stay out
OL,4,Aof former zoo
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are urging urban explorers not
OL,7,Fto enter restricted sites after damage
OL,8,Fwas caused to a former zoo.
OL,10,FDevon and Cornwall Police said there
OL,11,Fhad been a "number of incidents in
OL,12,Frecent weeks" at the former Living
OL,13,FCoasts site at Beacon Quay, Torquay,
OL,14,Fthat had led to damage, trespass and
OL,15,Farson.
OL,17,FOfficers said there were more patrols
OL,18,Fof the area while ARC Marine, which
OL,19,Fowns the site, has removed roof netting
OL,20,Ftrespassers had been using.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
