OL,3,GNEWSAUrban explorers urged to stay out
OL,4,Aof former zoo
OL,5,
OL,6,FTorquay neighbourhood Insp Rob Harvey
OL,7,Fsaid: "Stay out of the site, do not
OL,8,Fencourage others to enter, and think
OL,9,Fcarefully before following social media
OL,10,Ftrends that could put you in danger or
OL,11,Fleave you with a criminal record."
